# Local-only secrets for `wrangler pages dev` / `npm run preview`.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill in real values.

# Free-tier vision for the bet builder. https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# A busy football day is ~10 slips, far inside the free quota; repeats hit the KV cache and
# cost nothing.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Optional second free provider, used when Gemini errors, times out or is rate-limited
# (OpenRouter `:free`). Worth setting: it is the only real fallback for a slow Gemini call.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# Groq's free tier serves no vision model, so it is ignored unless named in VISION_PROVIDER.
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# VISION_PROVIDER=gemini
# VISION_MODEL=gemma-4-26b-a4b-it

# football-data.org (https://www.football-data.org/client/register) - league tables.
FOOTBALL_DATA_ORG_TOKEN=

# Cloudflare API token with "Workers KV Storage: Edit", plus account and namespace ids.
# Only needed to publish feeds locally instead of via GitHub Actions.
# CF_ACCOUNT_ID=
# CF_KV_NAMESPACE_ID=
# CF_API_TOKEN=

# Web Push (phone alerts). Generate a pair with `npm run push:keys`:
# the public half is also served to the browser by GET /api/push/key.
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=
# VAPID_SUBJECT=mailto:you@example.com

# Optional: route the disabled /api/analysis write-ups through Cloudflare AI Gateway.
# CF_GATEWAY_ID=
# CF_AIG_TOKEN=
